<!doctype html>
<html lang="nb">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>Høringsradar</title>
<script src="assets/theme.js?v={{ asset_version }}"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/site.css?v={{ asset_version }}">
<script src="assets/site.js?v={{ asset_version }}" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app" id="app">

  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="masthead-in">
      <div class="brand">
        <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="30" height="30" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" class="brand-bg"/>
          <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
            <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="9"/>
            <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="4.5"/>
            <path d="M16 16 L23 9"/>
          </g>
          <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="brand-name">Høringsradar</span>
      </div>

      <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Visning" id="nav">
        <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="aktuelle" aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="tab-label">På høring</span>
          <span class="tab-count" data-count="aktuelle">0</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="nye" aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="tab-label"><span class="long">Nye siden sist</span><span class="short" aria-hidden="true">Nye</span></span>
          <span class="tab-count" data-count="nye">0</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="alle" aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="tab-label">Alle</span>
          <span class="tab-count" data-count="alle">0</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="folger" aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="tab-label">Følger</span>
          <span class="tab-count" data-count="folger">0</span>
        </button>
      </nav>

      <div class="masthead-end">
        <span class="updated">Oppdatert {{ generated_label }}</span>
        <button type="button" class="link-btn about-link" id="about-btn">Om siden</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="page">
    <aside class="facets" id="facets" aria-label="Søk og filter">
      <div class="search">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5"/><path d="M16 16l4 4"/></g></svg>
        <input type="search" id="search" placeholder="Søk i høringer" aria-label="Søk i tittel, departement, sammendrag, begrunnelse og sektor" autocomplete="off">
      </div>

      <button type="button" class="btn filter-toggle" id="filter-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="facet-body">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 6h16M7 12h10M10 18h4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span id="filter-toggle-text">Filter</span>
      </button>

      <div class="facet-body" id="facet-body">
        <div class="facet" role="group" aria-labelledby="fh-rel">
          <h2 class="facet-h" id="fh-rel">Relevans</h2>
          <div class="rel-facet" id="rel-facet">
            <button type="button" class="rel-opt rel-hoy" data-rel="hoy" aria-pressed="false"><span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="rel-name">Høy</span><span class="rel-n" data-rel-count="hoy">0</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="rel-opt rel-middels" data-rel="middels" aria-pressed="false"><span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="rel-name">Middels</span><span class="rel-n" data-rel-count="middels">0</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="rel-opt rel-lav" data-rel="lav" aria-pressed="false"><span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="rel-name">Lav</span><span class="rel-n" data-rel-count="lav">0</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="rel-opt rel-ingen" data-rel="ingen" aria-pressed="false"><span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="rel-name">Ingen</span><span class="rel-n" data-rel-count="ingen">0</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="facet" role="group" aria-labelledby="fh-due">
          <h2 class="facet-h" id="fh-due">Frist</h2>
          <div class="seg" id="seg-due">
            <button type="button" data-due="" aria-pressed="true">Alle</button>
            <button type="button" data-due="1" aria-pressed="false">Innen 3 uker</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="facet" role="group" aria-labelledby="fh-addr">
          <h2 class="facet-h" id="fh-addr">Datatilsynet på adresselisten</h2>
          <div class="seg" id="seg-addr">
            <button type="button" data-addr="" aria-pressed="true">Alle</button>
            <button type="button" data-addr="yes" aria-pressed="false">Ja</button>
            <button type="button" data-addr="no" aria-pressed="false">Nei</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="facet">
          <label class="facet-h" for="f-sector">Sektor</label>
          <select id="f-sector"><option value="">Alle sektorer</option></select>
        </div>

        <div class="facet">
          <label class="facet-h" for="f-dept">Departement</label>
          <select id="f-dept"><option value="">Alle departementer</option></select>
        </div>

        <div class="facet">
          <label class="facet-h" for="period-select">Publisert</label>
          <select id="period-select">
            <option value="1">Siste uke</option>
            <option value="2">Siste 2 uker</option>
            <option value="3">Siste 3 uker</option>
            <option value="4">Siste 4 uker</option>
            <option value="8">Siste 8 uker</option>
            <option value="all" selected>Alle (siste {{ site_weeks }} uker)</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <button type="button" class="btn btn-quiet filter-reset" id="filter-reset" hidden>Nullstill filter</button>

        <ul class="legend" aria-label="Forklaring">
          <li><strong>Fet tittel:</strong> du har ikke åpnet høringen.</li>
          <li><span class="tag tag-new">Ny</span> og <span class="tag tag-changed">Endret</span> gjelder siden forrige besøk.</li>
          <li><span class="addr-tag">Adresseliste</span> Datatilsynet står på adresselisten.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="facet theme-facet" role="group" aria-labelledby="fh-theme">
          <h2 class="facet-h" id="fh-theme">Tema</h2>
          <div class="seg" id="seg-theme">
            <button type="button" data-theme-choice="system" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Auto, følger nettleseren">Auto</button>
            <button type="button" data-theme-choice="light" aria-pressed="false">Lys</button>
            <button type="button" data-theme-choice="dark" aria-pressed="false">Mørk</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="results" id="main">
      <noscript><p class="notice">Denne siden trenger JavaScript for å vise høringslisten. Høringsradar lister høringer fra regjeringen.no sortert etter personvernrelevans. Sorteringen er KI-generert og må kontrolleres mot kilden.</p></noscript>

      <div class="results-head">
        <div>
          <h1 class="view-title" id="view-title" tabindex="-1">På høring</h1>
          <p class="view-sub" id="view-sub"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="sort" role="group" aria-labelledby="sort-label">
          <span class="sort-label" id="sort-label">Sorter</span>
          <div class="seg" id="seg-sort">
            <button type="button" data-sort="relevans" aria-pressed="true">Relevans</button>
            <button type="button" data-sort="frist" aria-pressed="false">Frist</button>
            <button type="button" data-sort="publisert" aria-pressed="false">Publisert</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="chips" id="chips" aria-label="Aktive filtre"></div>

      <div id="list" class="list" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="loading">Laster høringer …</p>
      </div>

      <footer class="page-foot">
        <p>Høringsradar er et privat prosjekt og ikke en offisiell tjeneste. KI-generert sortering – kontroller mot kilden. <button type="button" class="link-btn" id="about-btn-2">Om siden</button></p>
        <p>Oppdatert {{ generated_label }}</p>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="drawer" id="drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="drawer-title" tabindex="-1" hidden>
  <div class="drawer-bar">
    <div class="drawer-bar-in">
      <button type="button" class="back-btn" id="drawer-close">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Tilbake<span class="long"> til oversikten</span></span>
      </button>
      <div class="pager" id="pager" aria-label="Bla i listen">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-small" id="pager-prev"><span aria-hidden="true">‹</span> Forrige</button>
        <span class="pager-pos" id="pager-pos"></span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-small" id="pager-next">Neste <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer-body" id="drawer-body"></div>
</div>

<div class="menu" id="row-menu" role="menu" hidden></div>

<dialog class="about" id="about-dialog" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <h2 id="about-title">Om siden</h2>
  <p>Høringsradar er et privat prosjekt og ikke en offisiell tjeneste. Relevansnivå, sammendrag, funn og sider å lese er KI-generert sortering og må kontrolleres mot kildedokumentene. Verktøyet tar ikke stilling til forslagene og skriver ikke høringsinnspill. Tittel, datoer, frist, departement og adresseliste er hentet direkte fra regjeringen.no. Sitater er kontrollert maskinelt mot dokumentteksten; sitater som ikke kunne bekreftes, er tydelig merket.</p>
  <p>Fet tittel i listen betyr at du ikke har åpnet høringen ennå. «Ny» og «Endret» gjelder siden forrige besøk (første gang: de siste 7 dagene). «Adresseliste» betyr at Datatilsynet står på høringens adresseliste.</p>
  <p class="muted">Dine valg (følger, leste høringer, sortering, tema) lagres bare i din egen nettleser.</p>
  <div class="about-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="about-close">Lukk</button></div>
</dialog>

<div class="sr-only" id="live" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
</body>
</html>
